==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*12 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~14.67 seconds<sup>400f~440f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>.
*1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Shy Boy is the main threat of this stage. Using [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]] easily repel him.

